    "one_line": "At 10:00, buy if the close sits in the bottom of its trailing one-session range (IBS); 1% stop, flat at 15:55. Source: Internal Bar Strength effect (Pagonidis, The IBS Effect: Mean Reversion in Equity ETFs, NAAIM 2014).",
    "family": "mean_reversion",
    "status": "ready_for_review"
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "book",
