      "claim": "At 10:00, buy if the close sits in the bottom of its trailing one-session range (IBS); 1% stop, flat at 15:55."
    }
  ],
  "hypothesis": {
    "behavior": "Closes near the bottom of the trailing range may revert upward.",
    "failure_theory": [
      "Daily IBS may not transfer to a rolling one-session window.",
      "Costs and next-bar fills may erase a published gross edge."
    ]
  },
